Algorithm: Loan Approval using Decision Tree Classifier
Start
Import the required libraries: Pandas, Decision Tree Classifier, train-test split, and accuracy score.
Read the loan approval CSV dataset.
Select Age, Income, LoanAmount, and CreditScore as input features.
Select Approved as the target variable.
Split the dataset into training data (80%) and testing data (20%).
Create a Decision Tree Classifier.
Train the Decision Tree using the training data.
Predict the loan approval for the testing data.
Calculate and display the accuracy of the model.
Enter the details of a new customer.
Use the trained Decision Tree to predict whether the loan is Approved or Rejected.
Display the loan decision.
Stop.
